{"id":"vod_lz_66061","vodId":"66061","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"七魔剑支配天下","name_cn":"七魔剑支配天下","date":"2023-01-01","year":"2023","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20230708-1/c0144ace133ecf1b1a2560ccf6e8dc11.jpg"},"summary":"舞台是名门金伯利魔法学校。在这所学校，毕业前有两成学生或残废或失踪，还有人发狂并最终死去。这就是所谓的“为魔所噬”——春天，奥利佛·霍恩来到了金伯利。他温和而理性，背后却有着若隐若现的阴影。他身边聚集起出身背景各不相同的少年少女，并与魔法师们尽可能地互相切磋。这些未来的魔法师们满怀希望地走过了学园的大门。然而，人称魔境的金伯利却对他们露出了危险的獠牙。与伙伴们邂逅，前往魔境的他将面临什么样的命运――于是，围绕“七魔剑”展开的故事，现在，开始了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-14 00:58:25","episodeCount":15,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn14.com/20230708/26278_dc2a8d7b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn14.com/20230715/26741_8e3a287d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn14.com/20230722/27116_0bbf3d30/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn14.com/20230729/27489_f9d582af/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn14.com/20230805/27974_8d20782e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn14.com/20230812/28192_d1bc59a0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn14.com/20230819/28385_e2a310a6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn14.com/20230826/28581_b76ee248/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20230902/28963_e6859d00/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20230909/29204_fe54f209/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20230916/29457_7539213d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20230923/29674_413ecb46/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20230930/29891_617080b7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20231007/30130_6cb96771/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20231014/30388_61b66197/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-1